## Provider 扩展键

- `providerOptions.ideogram-image.character_reference_images_mask`
- `providerOptions.ideogram-image.color_palette`
- `providerOptions.ideogram-image.endpoint`
- `providerOptions.ideogram-image.magic_prompt`
