| `poll.contentType` | `"application/json"` |

## Provider 扩展键

- `providerOptions.pika-via-fal.client_id`
- `providerOptions.pika-via-fal.input`
- `providerOptions.pika-via-fal.model`
- `providerOptions.pika-via-fal.statusPath`
